      "text": "Stream state:\n\ntype StreamState = {\n  requestId: string;\n  status:\n    | \"idle\"\n    | \"connecting\"\n    | \"streaming\"\n    | \"completed\"\n    | \"error\";\n\n  text: string;\n  error?: string;\n};",
