      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GET /jobs/:id/events (GET does not provide normal control over arbitrary request bodies/headers)\n\nvs.\n\nPOST /chat\nAuthorization: Bearer ...\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n  \"messages\": [...]\n} \n\n===> we stream based on response.body.getReader()\nSERVER still emit SSE-format events using EventSource vs fetch with body.stream",
